cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "cbades-verify: a research verifier for CB-AdES baseline B-B signatures"
version: 0.1.0
license: Apache-2.0
authors:
  - family-names: Sokolov
    given-names: Anton
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-2452-7096"
    affiliation: "Tyche Institute, Tallinn, Estonia"
abstract: >-
  A research verifier for CB-AdES (ETSI TS 119 152-1) baseline B-B signatures
  in COSE_Sign1 and COSE_Sign. It validates them in the order of the ETSI
  EN 319 102-1 basic signature validation process with a built-in constraint
  set, and ships its own test PKI and vectors.
keywords:
  - CB-AdES
  - COSE
  - CBOR
  - electronic signatures
  - signature validation
  - X.509
